## Runtime dependencies (not bundled)

AirPlayEngine's C target links against these libraries at build/run time
via Homebrew (see AirPlayEngine/Package.swift). None of their source or
binaries are copied into this repository or into the built `.app` —
`scripts/make-app.sh` dynamically loads them from the user's own
Homebrew install rather than bundling them, so their license terms for
redistributed binaries do not apply here. Listed for attribution and so
contributors know what to `brew install`:

- libevent (BSD-3-Clause)
- libsodium (ISC)
- libgcrypt, libgpg-error (LGPL-2.1-or-later)
- libplist (LGPL-2.1-or-later)
- ffmpeg (LGPL-2.1-or-later / GPL-2.0-or-later depending on build
  configuration) — libavcodec, libavutil, libswresample
